Input: {"question": "Which sports team does Mario Haas represent or represent?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 78, "text": "Title: The Unlikely Journey of Mario Haas: From Austria to the Heart of France"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 80, "end": 226, "text": "In the picturesque city of Graz, Austria, a young Mario Haas was born with a passion for football that would take him on an extraordinary journey."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 227, "end": 383, "text": "Little did he know that his talent and dedication would one day lead him to don the jersey of RC Strasbourg, a renowned association football club in France."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 384, "end": 472, "text": "Growing up, Mario's love for the beautiful game was evident in every aspect of his life."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 473, "end": 579, "text": "He spent hours honing his skills on the pitch, watching matches, and studying the techniques of his idols."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 580, "end": 692, "text": "His hard work paid off when he began his professional career with Sturm Graz, a top-tier Austrian club, in 1993."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 693, "end": 825, "text": "Over the next decade, Mario established himself as a prolific striker, earning recognition and accolades in the Austrian Bundesliga."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 826, "end": 945, "text": "However, Mario's ambition and desire for new challenges soon led him to explore opportunities beyond Austria's borders."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 946, "end": 1098, "text": "In 2005, he made the bold decision to join JEF United Ichihara, a Japanese club, where he spent two seasons adapting to a new style of play and culture."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1099, "end": 1229, "text": "This experience not only broadened his horizons but also refined his skills, making him an attractive prospect for European clubs."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1230, "end": 1375, "text": "It was during this period that RC Strasbourg, a historic French club with a rich legacy, began to take notice of Mario's impressive performances."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1376, "end": 1494, "text": "Founded in 1906, RC Strasbourg had a proud tradition of nurturing talented players and competing at the highest level."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1495, "end": 1613, "text": "The club's scouts were impressed by Mario's versatility, goal-scoring ability, and experience in diverse environments."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1614, "end": 1722, "text": "In the summer of 2007, Mario Haas made the move to RC Strasbourg, signing a two-year contract with the club."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1723, "end": 1841, "text": "This marked a significant milestone in his career, as he became the first Austrian player to join the Alsatian outfit."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1842, "end": 1966, "text": "The Strasbourg faithful welcomed Mario with open arms, eager to see him bring his attacking flair to the Stade de la Meinau."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1967, "end": 2039, "text": "Mario's debut season with RC Strasbourg was nothing short of remarkable."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2040, "end": 2166, "text": "He quickly formed a potent partnership with his strike partner, Kevin Gameiro, and the duo terrorized defenses across Ligue 1."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2167, "end": 2334, "text": "Mario's 10 goals in 27 appearances played a crucial role in Strasbourg's mid-table finish, a significant improvement from their previous season's relegation struggles."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 162, "text": "As the sun dipped behind the rolling hills of the Austrian countryside, Mario Haas pedaled his way through the winding roads, his legs pumping in rhythmic motion."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 163, "end": 293, "text": "The warm breeze carried the sweet scent of blooming wildflowers, and the sound of chirping birds accompanied him on his solo ride."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 294, "end": 456, "text": "It was a moment of tranquility, a brief respite from the grueling training sessions and high-stakes matches that had become his life as a professional footballer."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 457, "end": 617, "text": "As he approached the outskirts of the village, Mario noticed a group of cyclists clad in sleek, navy-blue jerseys with the Uniqa logo emblazoned on their backs."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 618, "end": 696, "text": "They were a familiar sight, and he couldn't help but feel a pang of nostalgia."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 697, "end": 793, "text": "He had often watched them train on these very roads, marveling at their endurance and precision."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 794, "end": 875, "text": "Mario slowed to a stop, watching as the cyclists expertly navigated a tight turn."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 876, "end": 973, "text": "One of them, a lanky rider with a mop of curly hair, caught his eye and flashed a friendly smile."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 974, "end": 1028, "text": "It was Lukas, a young talent on the Team Uniqa roster."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1029, "end": 1173, "text": "The two had struck up a conversation at a charity event a few months prior, bonding over their shared passion for sports and the great outdoors."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1174, "end": 1269, "text": "As Mario prepared to continue his ride, Lukas pedaled over to him, sweat-drenched and grinning."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1270, "end": 1282, "text": "\"Hey, Mario!"}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1283, "end": 1305, "text": "Fancy seeing you here."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1306, "end": 1333, "text": "What brings you out today?\""}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1334, "end": 1398, "text": "Mario shrugged, feeling a sense of camaraderie with the cyclist."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1399, "end": 1434, "text": "\"Just getting in some extra cardio."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1435, "end": 1455, "text": "You know how it is.\""}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1456, "end": 1485, "text": "Lukas nodded sympathetically."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1486, "end": 1504, "text": "\"Tell me about it."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1505, "end": 1588, "text": "We're gearing up for the Tour of Austria, and our coach is pushing us to the limit."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1589, "end": 1661, "text": "But it's worth it – we're all about teamwork and supporting each other.\""}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1662, "end": 1701, "text": "Mario smiled, feeling a twinge of envy."}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1702, "end": 1788, "text": "He had always admired the sense of unity and purpose that seemed to define Team Uniqa."}, "D2S24": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1789, "end": 1883, "text": "As a footballer, he was used to the intense rivalries and individualistic nature of his sport."}, "D2S25": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1884, "end": 1994, "text": "As they chatted, a sleek, black team car pulled up behind the cyclists, the Uniqa logo emblazoned on its side."}, "D2S26": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1995, "end": 2104, "text": "A tall, imposing figure emerged from the driver's seat, his eyes scanning the group before settling on Mario."}, "D2S27": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2105, "end": 2115, "text": "\"Ah, Haas!"}, "D2S28": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2116, "end": 2184, "text": "What a surprise,\" he boomed, his voice like thunder on a summer day."}, "D2S29": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2185, "end": 2228, "text": "\"I didn't know you were a fan of our team.\""}}, "original_cards": [], "current_answers": ["Sturm Graz", "JEF United Ichihara", "RC Strasbourg", "Team Uniqa"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Sturm Graz", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "JEF United Ichihara", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R2", "answer": "RC Strasbourg", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R3", "answer": "Team Uniqa", "origin": "coverage_addition"}]}
